{"title":"Career roadmap — NGO Relief Coordinator","role":"NGO Relief Coordinator","summary":"An NGO Relief Coordinator plans and coordinates humanitarian response during floods, cyclones, earthquakes, droughts, epidemics, displacement, and other emergencies. The role connects field operations, community needs, logistics, volunteers, government agencies, donors, and partner organisations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Disaster Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Disaster Management","Humanitarian Operations","GIS/Data","Logistics","Community Engagement"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Primary focus","Likely opportunities"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Disaster response, fieldwork, community engagement"},{"text":"NGO Relief Coordinator, Programme Assistant, Field Coordinator"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Humanitarian logistics, assessments, project management"},{"text":"Senior Relief Coordinator, Emergency Programme Officer"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Multi-project coordination, preparedness, donor management"},{"text":"Humanitarian Programme Manager, Emergency Response Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Disaster strategy, resilience, humanitarian leadership"},{"text":"Country Emergency Lead, Humanitarian Operations Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Sc.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Disaster and humanitarian foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Disaster management"},{"text":"Disaster risk"},{"text":"Hazard identification"},{"text":"Vulnerability"},{"text":"Exposure"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Emergency preparedness"},{"text":"Disaster response"},{"text":"Disaster recovery"},{"text":"Rehabilitation"},{"text":"Community resilience"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand major hazards:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Floods"},{"text":"Cyclones"},{"text":"Earthquakes"},{"text":"Landslides"},{"text":"Droughts"},{"text":"Heatwaves"},{"text":"Industrial accidents"},{"text":"Public-health emergencies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"First aid"},{"text":"Basic emergency communication"},{"text":"Field documentation"},{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Community interaction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Emergency operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Humanitarian response systems"},{"text":"Emergency needs assessment"},{"text":"Relief distribution"},{"text":"Shelter management"},{"text":"WASH"},{"text":"Food security"},{"text":"Health emergencies"},{"text":"Protection principles"},{"text":"Camp coordination fundamentals"},{"text":"Humanitarian logistics"},{"text":"Supply-chain management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"GPS"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Survey tools"},{"text":"Data collection platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop field capabilities:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rapid needs assessment"},{"text":"Household surveys"},{"text":"Beneficiary registration"},{"text":"Distribution planning"},{"text":"Stock tracking"},{"text":"Situation reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Coordination and programme management"},{"type":"p","text":"Build competence in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emergency response planning"},{"text":"Humanitarian project management"},{"text":"Incident coordination"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Volunteer management"},{"text":"Community engagement"},{"text":"Monitoring and evaluation"},{"text":"Accountability to affected populations"},{"text":"Donor reporting"},{"text":"Grant/project documentation"},{"text":"Risk communication"},{"text":"Disaster preparedness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Humanitarian information management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Honours/research route"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential dissertation topics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban flood vulnerability"},{"text":"Cyclone preparedness"},{"text":"Disaster response effectiveness"},{"text":"Community resilience"},{"text":"Disaster displacement"},{"text":"Humanitarian logistics"},{"text":"Heatwave preparedness"},{"text":"Disaster early-warning systems"},{"text":"NGO-government coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core skill stack"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Disaster science"},{"text":"Hazards, vulnerability, risk"}],[{"text":"Response"},{"text":"Emergency assessment, relief distribution"}],[{"text":"Humanitarian"},{"text":"Protection, WASH, food security"}],[{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Procurement, inventory, transportation"}],[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Mapping, spatial analysis"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, statistics, Power BI"}],[{"text":"Fieldwork"},{"text":"Surveys, assessments, reporting"}],[{"text":"Coordination"},{"text":"NGOs, government, communities"}],[{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Planning, budgets, timelines"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Situation reports, briefings, stakeholder coordination"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills","Career direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Emergency Relief"},{"text":"Response + distribution"},{"text":"Relief Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Humanitarian Logistics"},{"text":"Procurement + supply chain"},{"text":"Logistics Coordinator"}],[{"text":"WASH"},{"text":"Water, sanitation, hygiene"},{"text":"WASH Programme Officer"}],[{"text":"Shelter"},{"text":"Temporary housing + settlements"},{"text":"Shelter Coor