","items":[{"text":"UN humanitarian agencies"},{"text":"International NGOs"},{"text":"Red Cross/Red Crescent movement"},{"text":"Humanitarian research organisations"},{"text":"International development organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"High-value portfolio projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Flood response plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete response plan covering:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hazard","affected population","needs assessment","shelter","food","WASH","medical support","logistics","distribution","monitoring"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Disaster vulnerability map"},{"type":"p","text":"Use GIS to map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Flood zones"},{"text":"Critical infrastructure"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Evacuation routes"},{"text":"Relief centres"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Relief distribution dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Beneficiaries"},{"text":"Supplies"},{"text":"Stock"},{"text":"Distribution points"},{"text":"Delivery status"},{"text":"Unmet needs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Emergency needs assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a survey covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Household size"},{"text":"Shelter damage"},{"text":"Food needs"},{"text":"Water access"},{"text":"Medical requirements"},{"text":"Livelihood loss"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — NGO disaster simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Run a simulated emergency where you manage:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"72-hour response"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Volunteers"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Situation reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should show field logic, coordination, data, logistics and measurable outcomes, not just theoretical disaster plans."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Useful learning"],"rows":[[{"text":"First aid"},{"text":"First aid + basic emergency response"}],[{"text":"Disaster"},{"text":"Disaster-risk reduction"}],[{"text":"Humanitarian"},{"text":"Humanitarian response fundamentals"}],[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"QGIS"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel + Power BI"}],[{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Project-management fundamentals"}],[{"text":"M&E"},{"text":"Monitoring and evaluation"}],[{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Humanitarian supply chain"}],[{"text":"WASH"},{"text":"Emergency WASH fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Safeguarding"},{"text":"Protection + safeguarding principles"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant humanitarian frameworks and standards should be learned as concepts, not merely memorised for certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NGO Relief Coordinator"},{"text":"Programme Assistant"},{"text":"Field Coordinator"},{"text":"Disaster Management Assistant"},{"text":"Relief Operations Assistant"},{"text":"Community Mobilisation Officer"},{"text":"Programme Officer"},{"text":"Disaster Risk Reduction Assistant"},{"text":"Humanitarian Operations Assistant"},{"text":"Emergency Response Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emergency Programme Officer"},{"text":"Humanitarian Logistics Coordinator"},{"text":"Disaster Risk Reduction Officer"},{"text":"Humanitarian Programme Manager"},{"text":"Emergency Response Manager"},{"text":"Disaster Preparedness Manager"},{"text":"Humanitarian Operations Manager"},{"text":"Resilience Programme Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer → useful skills"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Important skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Disaster-response NGO"},{"text":"Field coordination + relief"}],[{"text":"International NGO"},{"text":"Programme management + reporting"}],[{"text":"Government"},{"text":"Emergency coordination + administration"}],[{"text":"UN/humanitarian agency"},{"tex